## 9. Live Threat Detection & Attack Simulation

To confirm end-to-end telemetry collection, execute a simulated **Logon Failure Attack**:

1. Open PowerShell on the monitored Windows machine (`pc1`).
2. Run the failed credential request command:
```powershell
runas /user:fakeuser notepad.exe

```


3. Enter an incorrect password when prompted.
4. Open **Wazuh Dashboard** → **Security operations** → **Security events**.
5. Set the time range filter to **Last 15 minutes**.
6. **Result:** Wazuh catches the event real-time and logs a **Windows: Failed logon attempt / Authentication Failure** alert!

